        "original_id": "ee672c73-9b34-53dd-84a6-daad45ea5d26",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jay Park, Sol Kyung-gu, Jung Woo-sung, Han Hyo-joo, Jin Kyung, Lee Junho\n- Groups: 2PM\n- Products: Ultra Lover, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", Go Crazy, Cold Eyes\n- Places: Makuhari Messe\n\nFacts:\n- Jay Park officially left 2PM in early 2010 after serving as the group's former leader.\n- The group's second live DVD, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", was associated with Makuhari Messe.\n- Ultra Lover was released along with 2PM's second live DVD, 1st Japan Tour 2011 \"Take Off\", in Makuhari Messe.\n- Cold Eyes is a 2013 South Korean film starring Sol Kyung-gu, Jung Woo-sung, Han Hyo-joo, Jin Kyung, and Lee Junho.\n- Go Crazy is the fourth Korean studio album and seventh overall album by the South Korean boy band 2PM.",
